{"headword":"מַגֵּפָה²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. blow, slaughter, plague, pestilence</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:37\" href=\"/Numbers.14.37\">Nu 14:37</a> + 23 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַגֵּפַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:15\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.15\">Zc 14:15</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַגֵּפֹתַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:14\" href=\"/Exodus.9.14\">Ex 9:14</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>blow</em>, = fatal stroke <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.16\">Ez 24:16</a>; in divine judgment (plague) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:14\" href=\"/Exodus.9.14\">Ex 9:14</a> (J)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>slaughter</em> in battle, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:17\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.17\">1 S 4:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:9\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.9\">2 S 17:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.7\">18:7</a>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>plague, pestilence</em> (divine judgment), of tumours on Philistines <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 6:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.6.4\">1 S 6:4</a>; against Isr <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:37\" href=\"/Numbers.14.37\">Nu 14:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:13\" href=\"/Numbers.17.13\">17:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:14\" href=\"/Numbers.17.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 17:15\" href=\"/Numbers.17.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:8\" href=\"/Numbers.25.8\">25:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:9\" href=\"/Numbers.25.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:18\" href=\"/Numbers.25.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 26:1\" href=\"/Numbers.26.1\">19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:16\" href=\"/Numbers.31.16\">31:16</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:21\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.21\">2 S 24:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:25\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.25\">25</a> (ins. also v <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 14:15\" href=\"/Zechariah.14.15\">15</a> 𝔊 Th We Klo Dr Kit Bu), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicl